hadiths[28]{hadithnumber,text}:
"522","[AI-translation] Hazrat Zaid bin Khalid Juhani, Abu Hurairah aur Shibl [Raziyallahu anhum] se riwayat hai ke woh Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas the; ek aadmi khada hua aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah, hamare darmiyan Kitabullah se faisla farmayen. Us ke mukhalif ne kaha, jo us se zyada samajhdar tha: Sach kaha Ya Rasulullah, hamare darmiyan Kitabullah se faisla farmayen, mujhe kehne ki ijazat den. Aap ne farmaya: 'Kaho.' Us ne kaha: Beshak mera beta is ke paas mazdoor tha; us ne us ki biwi se zina kiya. To main ne us se sau bakriyan aur khadim dekar fidya diya. Main ne ahle ilm se poocha; unhon ne mujhe khabar di ke mere bete par sau kode aur ek saal ki jilawatni hai, aur is aadmi ki biwi par rajm hai. To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Qasam Us ki jis ke hath mein meri jaan hai, main tum dono ke darmiyan Kitabullah se faisla farmaunga: Sau bakriyan aur khadim tumhen wapas; tumhare bete par sau kode aur ek saal ki jilawatni. Aur Ai Unais, Aslam ke ek aadmi ke liye, is ki biwi ke paas jao; agar woh iqrar kare to use rajm karo.' To woh us ke paas gaya; us ne iqrar kiya aur us ne use rajm kiya. Sufyan kehte hain: Aseef yani mazdoor."
"523","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko Yahudi mard aur Yahudi aurat ko rajm farmate dekha; main ne Aap ko dekha ke Aap us [aurat] par jhuk kar use patharon se bacha rahe the."
"524","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Aslam ke ek aadmi, aur Yahud ke ek mard aur aurat ko rajm farmaya."
"525","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Beshak Yahud Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aae; unhon ne Aap se zikr kiya ke un mein se ek mard aur aurat ne zina kiya. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un se farmaya: 'Tum Taurat mein rajm ke bare mein kya pate ho?' Unhon ne kaha: Ham unhen ruswa karte hain aur woh kode lagaye jate hain. To Abdullah bin Salam ne kaha: Tum ne jhoot kaha; beshak us mein rajm hai. To woh Taurat lae aur use khola; un mein se ek ne apna hath rajm ki ayat par rakha aur us se pehle aur us ke ba'd padha. To Abdullah bin Salam ne us se kaha: Apna hath uthao. To us ne apna hath uthaya to us mein rajm ki ayat thi. To unhon ne kaha: Sach kaha Ai Muhammad, us mein rajm ki ayat hai. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un dono ke bare mein hukm diya aur woh dono rajm kiye gae. Abdullah bin Umar kehte hain: Main ne mard ko aurat par jhukte dekha use patharon se bachata hua."
"526","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah aur Zaid bin Khalid Juhani (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne use khabar di ke do aadmi Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas jhagda lekar aae. Un mein se ek ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, hamare darmiyan Kitabullah se faisla farmayen. Dusre ne kaha, jo un dono mein zyada samajhdar tha: Ji Ya Rasulullah, hamare darmiyan Kitabullah Azz wa Jall se faisla farmayen, mujhe bolne ki ijazat den. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Bolo.' Us ne kaha: Beshak mera beta is ke paas mazdoor tha aur us ne us ki biwi se zina kiya. Mujhe khabar di gayi ke mere bete par rajm hai; to main ne us se sau bakriyan aur apni bandi dekar fidya diya. Phir main ne ahle ilm se poocha; unhon ne mujhe khabar di ke mere bete par sau kode aur ek saal ki jilawatni hai, rajm sirf us ki biwi par hai. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Rahi baat, qasam Us ki jis ke hath mein meri jaan hai, main tum dono ke darmiyan Kitabullah se faisla farmaunga: Rahi tumhari bakriyan aur tumhari bandi woh tumhen wapas. Us ne us ke bete ko sau kode lagaye aur ek saal jilawatan farmaya. Aur Unais Aslami ko hukm diya ke dusre ki biwi ke paas jae; agar woh iqrar kare to use rajm kare. Us ne iqrar kiya aur us ne use rajm kiya. Malik kehte hain: Aseef yani mazdoor."
"527","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Sa'd bin Ubadah ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se kaha: Bataiye agar main apni biwi ke sath kisi mard ko paon to kya use mohlat dun yahan tak ke chaar gawah laon?! Aap ne farmaya: 'Han.'"
"528","[AI-translation] Hazrat Zaid bin Khalid [Raziyallahu anhu] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas baithe the; ek aadmi Aap ke paas aaya aur kaha: Beshak meri bandi ne zina kiya. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Use kode lagao; phir agar zina kare to use kode lagao; phir agar zina kare to use kode lagao; phir agar zina kare to use bech do agarche rassi [ke badle] ho.'"
"529","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah aur Zaid bin Khalid [Raziyallahu anhuma] se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se bandi ke bare mein poocha gaya jab woh zina kare jabke ghair muhsana [ghair shadi shuda] ho, to Aap ne farmaya: 'Agar zina kare to use kode lagao; phir agar zina kare to use kode lagao; phir agar zina kare to use kode lagao; phir agar zina kare to use kode lagao; phir use bech do agarche rassi [ke badle] ho.' Ibn Shihab kehte hain: Main nahin janta teesri ke ba'd ya chauthi [ke ba'd bechne ka hukm]; zafeer yani rassi hai."
"530","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah [Raziyallahu anha] se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Chor ka hath chauthai deenar ya upar [qemat par] kata jae.'"
"531","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne chor ka [hath] ek dhaal par kata jis ki qeemat teen dirham thi."
"532","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar [Raziyallahu anhuma] se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne chor ka hath ek dhaal par kata jis ki qeemat teen dirham ya chauthai deenar lagai gayi."
"533","[AI-translation] Safwan bin Abdullah bin Safwan (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai ke Safwan bin Umayyah se kaha gaya: Beshak jo hijrat na kare halaak hua. To Safwan bin Umayyah Madinah aae; woh masjid mein soe aur apni chadar ka takiya banaya. To chor aaya aur us ki chadar le gaya. To Safwan ne chor ko pakda aur use Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas lae. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne us ke bare mein hukm diya ke us ka hath kata jae. To Safwan ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, main ne yeh nahin chaha; woh us ke liye sadqa hai. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Phir use mere paas lane se pehle kyun nahin [muaf kiya].'"
"534","[AI-translation] Muhammad bin Yahya bin Hibban (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai ke ek ghulam ne ek aadmi ke bagh se khajoor ka pauda churaya aur use apne aaqa ke bagh mein lagaya. To paude ka malik apna pauda talash karta nikla; us ne use paya aur ghulam par Marwan bin Hakam se faryad ki. To Marwan ne ghulam ko qaid kiya aur us ka hath katne ka irada farmaya. To ghulam ka aaqa Rafi bin Khadij ke paas gaya aur un se is ke bare mein poocha. Unhon ne use khabar di ke unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: 'Phal mein aur na [khajoor ke] gude mein [hath] katna hai.' Us aadmi ne kaha: Marwan bin Hakam ne mere ghulam ko pakda hai jabke woh us ka hath katna chahta hai; main chahta hun ke tum mere sath us ke paas chalo aur use woh sunao jo tum ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se suna. To Rafi us ke sath chale yahan tak ke Marwan ke paas aae. Unhon ne kaha: Tum ne is ke ghulam ko pakda hai? Us ne kaha: Ji. Unhon ne kaha: Tum us ke sath kya karne wale ho. Us ne kaha: Main ne us ka hath katne ka irada kiya hai. To Rafi ne us se kaha: Beshak main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: 'Phal mein aur na [khajoor ke] gude mein [hath] katna hai.' To Marwan ne ghulam ke bare mein hukm diya aur use chhor diya gaya."
"535","[AI-translation] Wasi bin Hibban (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai ke ek ghulam ne ek aadmi ke bagh se khajoor ka pauda churaya; woh use laya aur dusri jagah lagaya. To use Marwan bin Hakam ke paas laya gaya; unhon ne use katne ka irada farmaya. To Rafi bin Khadij ne gawahi di ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Phal mein aur na [khajoor ke] gude mein [hath] katna hai.'"
"536","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah [Raziyallahu anha] se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Har sharab jo nasha lae woh haram hai.'"
"537","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah [Raziyallahu anha] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se bit [shehed ki sharab] ke bare mein poocha gaya, to Aap ne farmaya: 'Har sharab jo nasha lae woh haram hai.'"
"538","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham ne Hudaibiyah wale saal Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath oont saat [aadmiyon] ki taraf se, gae saat [aadmiyon] ki taraf se zibah ki."
"539","[AI-translation] Ma'bad bin Ka'b ki walida [Raziyallahu anha], jinhon ne dono qiblon ki taraf namaz padhi thi, se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne khalitatein [do qism ke phalon ko mila kar nabeez banane] se mana farmaya."
"540","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne apni ba'z jang mein logon ko khutba diya. Abdullah bin Umar kehte hain: Main Aap ki taraf mutawajjah hua; Aap mere pahunchne se pehle wapas gae. To main ne poocha: Aap ne kya farmaya? Unhon ne kaha: 'Aap ne tumbi aur [taar lagin] bartan mein nabeez banane se mana farmaya.'"
"541","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne tumbi aur [taar lagin] bartan mein nabeez banane se mana farmaya."
"542","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne tumbi aur [taar lagin] bartan mein nabeez banane se mana farmaya. Kabhi Sufyan kehte: Tumbi aur [taar lagin] bartan se ke us mein nabeez banaya jae."
"543","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: 'Tumbi aur [taar lagin] bartan mein nabeez na banao.'"
"544","[AI-translation] Ibn Abi Aufa [Abdullah bin Abi Aufa Raziyallahu anhu] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne sabz, safed aur surkh matke ki nabeez se mana farmaya."
"545","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir [Raziyallahu anhu] se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke liye mashkize mein nabeez banai jati; agar na hoti to pathar ke bartan [mein]."
"546","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr bin Al-Aas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne bartanon se mana farmaya to Aap se kaha gaya: Har ek ke paas mashkiza nahin hai. To Aap ne unhen ghair taar lagin matke [mein nabeez] ki ijazat di."
"547","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne tumbi, hantam [sabz matke], naqeer [khajoor ki jad se bane bartan], aur [taar lagin] bartan se mana farmaya."
"548","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id Khudri [Raziyallahu anhu] se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mashkizon ko mod kar [munh se peene] se mana farmaya."
"549","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id Khudri [Raziyallahu anhu] se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mashkizon ko modne se mana farmaya: Ke unhen toda [moda] jae aur un ke muhano se piya jae."
